utput goes to the same folder as the generated video: output/motion/production/<name>/\n  video_2x_*.mp4 (1792x3200) and video_1080x1920_*.mp4\nAudio and fps come from the input video.\nIf the upscale invents too much detail: lower \"detail\" in VSR Decode (e.g. 0.7) = new version."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"W6 v3 — UPSCALE of the generated video (PRODUCTION 3/3)\nLocal RelayVSR x2. ~1 min.\n\n1. After W5, run: python catalog.py upscale <name>\n   (copies the video to input/motion/production/<name>.mp4)\n2. Pick that file in \"Video to upscale\".\n3. Video name = the same one used in W5 (<product>_<pose>).\n\nOutput goes to the same folder as the generated video: output/motion/production/<name>/\n  video_2x_*.mp4 (1792x3200) and video_1080x1920_*.mp4\nAudio and fps come from the input video.\nIf the upscale invents too much detail: lower \"detail\" in VSR Decode (e.g. 0.7) = new version."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[1,1,0,2,1,"STRING"],[2,2,0,3,0,"STRING"],[3,2,0,4,0,"STRING"],[4,10,0,11,0,"VIDEO"],[5,12,0,14,0,"MODEL"],[6,11,0,14,1,"IMAGE"],[7,12,0,15,0,"MODEL"],[8,14,0,15,1,"CONDITIONING"],[9,14,0,15,2,"CONDITIONING"],[10,14,1,15,3,"LATENT"],[11,13,0,16,0,"VAE"],[12,15,0,16,1,"LATENT"],[13,11,0,16,2,"IMAGE"],[14,16,0,17,0,"IMAGE"],[15,11,1,17,1,"AUDIO"],[16,11,2,17,2,"FLOAT"],[19,16,0,19,0,"IMAGE"],[20,19,0,20,0,"IMAGE"],[21,11,1,20,1,"AUDIO"],[22,11,2,20,2,"FLOAT"],[17,17,0,18,0,"VIDEO"],[18,3,0,18,1,"STRING"],[23,20,0,21,0,"VIDEO"],[24,4,0,21,1,"STRING"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"COMMON (name and folders)","bounding":[31.918212909115585,26.356336572528875,340,520],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}},{"id":2,"title":"INPUT (motion/production/<name>.mp4, copied by catalog.py upscale)","bounding":[400,20,360,620],"color":"#8A8","flags":{}},{"id":3,"title":"UPSCALE RelayVSR x2","bounding":[780,20,736.8929366457619,616.8217953423473],"color":"#a1309b","flags":{}},{"id":4,"title":"OUTPUTS (2x and 1080x1920)","bounding":[1552.748168812191,23.8388684